# 🏠 House Price Prediction — Linear Regression

Predicting house prices using linear regression on features such as size,
bedrooms, and location score.

## 📁 Project Structure
- `data/house_data.csv` — 50-row synthetic dataset
- `src/` — modular Python code (loader, preprocessing, model, eval, visual)
- `outputs/` — generated plots and predictions
- `main.py` — end-to-end pipeline

## 🚀 How to Run

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python main.py